# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map classical inputs to a quantum problem {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Petakan input klasik kepada masalah kuantum {#step-1-map-classical-inputs-to-a-quantum-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define $Li_2S$ geometries in dictionary format for different Li-S bond distances to calculate the PES curve. These geometries are optimized using B3LYP/631g calculations.\n"
msgstr "Tentukan geometri $Li_2S$ dalam format kamus untuk jarak ikatan Li-S yang berbeza bagi mengira lengkung PES. Geometri-geometri ini dioptimumkan menggunakan pengiraan B3LYP/631g.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The HI-VQE calculations use the options defined in the following cell. With the STO-3G basis, $Li_2S$ has 19 spatial orbitals and 22 electrons. To run the (10o,12e) case with HI-VQE, define 10 active orbitals and freeze the five lowest orbitals, which leaves 12 active electrons. At each iteration, 100 shots are used to sample the electron configurations generated by the ExcitationPreserving quantum circuit (`epa`) with `circular` entanglement and two repetitions (`reps`). The maximum number of iterations is set to 30, which allows enough iterations for the energy to converge.\n"
msgstr "Pengiraan HI-VQE menggunakan pilihan yang ditakrifkan dalam sel berikut. Dengan asas STO-3G, $Li_2S$ mempunyai 19 orbital spatial dan 22 elektron. Untuk menjalankan kes (10o,12e) dengan HI-VQE, takrifkan 10 orbital aktif dan bekukan lima orbital terendah, yang meninggalkan 12 elektron aktif. Pada setiap iterasi, 100 shot digunakan untuk mengambil sampel konfigurasi elektron yang dijana oleh litar kuantum ExcitationPreserving (`epa`) dengan jalinan `circular` dan dua ulangan (`reps`). Bilangan iterasi maksimum ditetapkan kepada 30, yang membolehkan iterasi yang mencukupi untuk tenaga menumpu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Steps 2 and 3: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution and execute using the HI-VQE Chemistry function {#steps-2-and-3-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution-and-execute-using-the-hi-vqe-chemistry-function}"
msgstr "Langkah 2 dan 3: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan kuantum dan laksanakan menggunakan fungsi HI-VQE Chemistry {#steps-2-and-3-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution-and-execute-using-the-hi-vqe-chemistry-function}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a `for` loop that submits an HI-VQE job for each geometry, with the options defined previously. In this tutorial, you submit six geometries and retrieve the results after all jobs complete. In the main function run, define `max_states` to control the maximum size of the subspace matrix, and `max_expansion_states` to control how many states classical CI expansion methods can generate per iteration. The function job IDs are stored in a dictionary under each geometry label, so that you can track and process the output.\n"
"These geometries need 20 qubits and run with `max_states=40000`, so the calculator gives `M`. They share their active space and `max_states`, so the size is calculated once.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan gelung `for` yang menghantar job HI-VQE bagi setiap geometri, dengan pilihan yang ditakrifkan sebelum ini. Dalam tutorial ini, anda menghantar enam geometri dan mendapatkan semula keputusan selepas semua job selesai. Dalam jalankan fungsi utama, takrifkan `max_states` untuk mengawal saiz maksimum matriks subruang, dan `max_expansion_states` untuk mengawal berapa banyak keadaan yang boleh dijana oleh kaedah pengembangan CI klasik bagi setiap iterasi. ID job fungsi disimpan dalam kamus di bawah setiap label geometri, supaya anda dapat menjejak dan memproses output.\n"
"Geometri ini memerlukan 20 qubit dan dijalankan dengan `max_states=40000`, jadi pengira memberikan `M`. Ia berkongsi ruang aktif dan `max_states`, jadi saiz dikira sekali sahaja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Check](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status) whether the jobs are still running or have completed.\n"
msgstr "[Semak](/guides/functions-get-started#check-job-status) sama ada job masih berjalan atau sudah selesai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After all jobs complete, [retrieve](/guides/functions-get-started#retrieve-results) the calculation results.\n"
msgstr "Selepas semua job selesai, [dapatkan semula](/guides/functions-get-started#retrieve-results) keputusan pengiraan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The results file for each of the calculations can be downloaded into the current directory, under its own name, with `catalog.file_download()`. See [Manage files across runs](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) for how files are moved to and from a function. These files contain `\"states\"`, `\"eigenvector\"`, `\"energy_history\"`, `\"final_energy\"`, and `\"final_energy_variance\"`.\n"
msgstr "Fail keputusan bagi setiap pengiraan boleh dimuat turun ke direktori semasa, di bawah namanya sendiri, dengan `catalog.file_download()`. Lihat [Manage files across runs](/guides/manage-files-across-managed-workflows) untuk mengetahui cara fail dipindahkan ke dan daripada fungsi. Fail ini mengandungi `\"states\"`, `\"eigenvector\"`, `\"energy_history\"`, `\"final_energy\"`, dan `\"final_energy_variance\"`.\n"

