msgid "The entire QPU runtime used in the job can be tracked by logging in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and viewing submitted jobs with the `qunova-chemistry-hivqe` tag. To find the IBM Quantum Compute jobs of one function job from code, see [Access the associated Quantum Compute jobs](/guides/functions-get-started#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs).\n"
msgstr "Jumlah masa jalan QPU yang digunakan dalam job boleh dijejaki dengan log masuk ke [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) dan melihat job yang dihantar dengan tag `qunova-chemistry-hivqe`. Untuk mencari job IBM Quantum Compute bagi satu job fungsi daripada kod, lihat [Access the associated Quantum Compute jobs](/guides/functions-get-started#access-the-associated-quantum-compute-jobs).\n"

